<!--
     Standard size sets already ship as seed data in garment_style_library
     (data/garment_size_set_data.xml -> size_set_international covers
     XXS-5XL, which fits all three styles below). garment.style has no direct
     size-set relation field, so no garment.size.set record is duplicated
     here; downstream Order Management batches reference
     garment_style_library.size_set_international directly.
-->
